---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Pension Plan Administrator for Business Owners | Sterling Pension Group" description="Sterling Pension Group is a pension plan administrator for business owners. We design and administer Defined Benefit and Cash Balance plans.">

<section class="wrap hero">
  <div>
    <p class="kicker">Third-party pension administration</p>
    <h1>Pension plan administrator for business owners.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Sterling Pension Group is a third-party pension plan administrator. We design and administer Defined Benefit and Cash Balance plans so owners can move more of today’s income into retirement—without making the process feel complicated.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Find my plan path →</a>
      <a class="btn outline" href="/calculator">Estimate contribution room</a>
    </div>
    <div class="checks"><span>✓ Complimentary first conversation</span><span>✓ Built for owner-led businesses</span><span>✓ Serving clients nationwide</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="visual">
    <img src="/images/hero.jpg" alt="Business owners reviewing a retirement plan in a private office" />
    <div class="stat"><span>Contribution potential</span><strong>$250k+</strong><em style="font-size:12px;color:#5b6678;font-style:normal;">depending on your facts</em></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap">
  <div><div class="num">01</div><h3>Strategic plan design</h3><p>for your real business</p></div>
  <div><div class="num">02</div><h3>Clear administration</h3><p>without the runaround</p></div>
  <div><div class="num">03</div><h3>Long-term perspective</h3><p>for the life you want</p></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Two paths. One bigger picture.</p>
  <h2>Make more of the income your business creates.</h2>
  <p class="lede">The right pension arrangement can help you shift more of today’s income toward long-term wealth. We help you understand the trade-offs and move forward with confidence.</p>
  <div class="two" style="margin-top:28px;">
    <a class="card" href="/defined-benefit"><img src="/images/plans.jpg" alt="" /><p class="kicker">Plan path 01</p><h3>Defined Benefit Plans</h3><p>A powerful structure for business owners who want predictable retirement value and larger deductible contributions.</p><span>Explore the approach →</span></a>
    <a class="card" href="/cash-balance"><img src="/images/cash.jpg" alt="" /><p class="kicker">Plan path 02</p><h3>Cash Balance Plans</h3><p>An account-based Defined Benefit structure that makes substantial contributions easier to visualize and track.</p><span>See how it works →</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Why Sterling</p>
  <h2>Expertise without the distance.</h2>
  <div class="grid3" style="margin-top:24px;">
    <article class="panel"><div class="num">01</div><h3>Designed for higher earners</h3><p>Turn strong business income into a disciplined retirement strategy with room to contribute meaningfully beyond a standard 401(k).</p></article>
    <article class="panel"><div class="num">02</div><h3>Built around your business</h3><p>We coordinate plan design, documentation, administration, and compliance workflows around the way your company actually operates.</p></article>
    <article class="panel"><div class="num">03</div><h3>A direct, human partner</h3><p>Work with the people who know your plan—not a call center. We make complex pension decisions easier to understand and act on.</p></article>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="section wrap split">
  <div>
    <p class="kicker">Administration that stays ahead</p>
    <h2>The details get handled. You stay in the loop.</h2>
    <p>A well-designed plan only works when the annual details are managed with discipline. Sterling supports the ongoing work behind the scenes—from census data and testing to participant communication and compliance coordination.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Defined Benefit and Cash Balance plan design support</li>
      <li>Annual administration, testing, and reporting</li>
      <li>Clear communication with owners, employees, and advisors</li>
      <li>Coordination with independent Enrolled Actuaries when required</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="btn outline" href="/administration">View TPA & administration services</a>
  </div>
  <img class="photo" src="/images/admin.jpg" alt="A team meeting around a conference table" style="height:420px;" />
</section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">A calmer way forward</p>
  <h2>Simple on the surface. Thoughtful underneath.</h2>
  <div class="steps" style="margin-top:24px;">
    <div><p class="num" style="font-size:36px;">01</p><h3>Start with a short conversation</h3><p>We learn how your business is structured and what you want retirement to look like.</p></div>
    <div><p class="num" style="font-size:36px;">02</p><h3>Model the right plan shape</h3><p>We work through contribution targets, employee considerations, timing, and design trade-offs with your professional advisors.</p></div>
    <div><p class="num" style="font-size:36px;">03</p><h3>Put the plan to work</h3><p>From documentation and onboarding to annual administration and reporting, Sterling stays close to the details.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="cta">
  <div><p class="kicker">Your next chapter starts here</p><h2>Make the most of the years you’re building toward.</h2><p>Tell us where your business is today. We’ll help you see what a better retirement plan could look like.</p></div>
  <a class="btn gold" href="/contact">Set up a complimentary call</a>
</div></section>

</Base>
